---
// The long-form About copy that sits under AboutStory. Each block is its own
// section so the page keeps the home page's rhythm — a flat square band, then
// a raised rounded panel, alternating. AboutStory above is flat, so the first
// block here is raised to keep that alternation going.
//
// Within a block: the heading sits on its own, held to half the width so it
// breaks into a stack rather than one long thin line, with the body copy
// underneath at full width. Wording is the client's own copy — see the memory
// note on not editing it without their sign-off.
const solutions = [
  'Upmarket kitchens and custom cabinetry',
  'Bedroom built-in cupboards, dressing rooms and associated furniture',
  'Executive bars and Mediterranean pubs',
  'Exclusive TV units and entertainment areas',
  'Studies and home offices',
  'Libraries and bookcases',
  'Bathroom vanities and related fittings',
  'Wall units and display cabinetry',
  'Slatted and feature wall panels',
  'Bespoke shelving and storage solutions',
  'New range steel / glass fabricated wall units',
];
---

<section class="raised-panel about-block">
  <h2 class="about-block__heading">Bespoke Interiors, Designed Around You</h2>
  <div class="about-block__copy">
    <p>Our philosophy is simple: your home should be as individual as you are.</p>
    <p>
      We specialise in creating customised spaces that combine timeless design with contemporary functionality. From
      the initial concept and space planning through to manufacture and installation, every project is carefully
      considered and tailored to our client’s lifestyle, taste and requirements.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our expertise extends beyond kitchens and cupboards to a comprehensive range of bespoke interior solutions,
      including:
    </p>
    <ul class="about-block__list">
      {solutions.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
    </ul>
    <p>
      We also incorporate premium finishes and carefully selected accessories, including quartz stone tops, glass
      cladding, aluminium and glass doors, suspended shelving, imported sinks, hardware and integrated appliances,
      creating interiors that are both visually striking and highly practical.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="flat-section about-block">
  <h2 class="about-block__heading">Where Traditional Craft Meets Modern Design</h2>
  <div class="about-block__copy">
    <p>
      At NDI, we believe great interiors are created by combining the character and charm of timeless design with the
      innovation and technology of today.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our advanced design software allows clients to visualise their proposed space in impressive graphic detail
      before production begins. Every cabinet and element is purpose-made to the approved design and manufactured to
      the client’s exact specifications. We do not believe in forcing your home into standard sizes — we create
      customised solutions specifically for your space.
    </p>
    <p>
      From concept to completion, our experienced team maintains close attention to detail, ensuring that design
      intent, quality and craftsmanship are carried through every stage of the project.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="raised-panel about-block">
  <h2 class="about-block__heading">Our Commitment</h2>
  <div class="about-block__copy">
    <p>
      Our mission is to create distinctive and unique expressions of your lifestyle through thoughtful design and
      exceptional workmanship.
    </p>
    <p>
      We believe that integrity, communication, courtesy and attention to detail are the foundations of lasting
      client relationships. Our hands-on approach means we remain personally involved throughout the process, from
      the first consultation to final installation.
    </p>
    <p>
      The result is more than cabinetry. It is a carefully crafted interior that enhances the way you live and
      provides something you can take pride in for years to come.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="flat-section about-block">
  <h2 class="about-block__heading">Our Philosophy</h2>
  <div class="about-block__copy">
    <p>
      We believe our clients are our greatest ambassadors. Much of our growth has been built on trust, referrals and
      word-of-mouth recommendations, earned through consistently delivering quality products and personalised
      service.
    </p>
    <p>
      At New Dimension Interiors, every project is an opportunity to create something exceptional — designed for you,
      made for your space and built to last.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="raised-panel about-block">
  <h2 class="about-block__heading">Who We Are</h2>
  <div class="about-block__copy">
    <p>
      Since starting out back in 2002 as a small business, over the past ten years the young current Chief Exec —
      Tamsin Scott — has re-branded and re-invented the new company by transforming it into a successful privately
      owned company which continues to evolve from strength to strength delivering high quality, excellent service
      into the middle and upmarket segment of home improvement.
    </p>
    <p>
      After completing her formal schooling Tamsin, a prominent 32 year old “southern suburbs Johannesburg girl”,
      spent a year in the USA visiting and working in 22 states, and is now fully qualified with a Bachelor’s Degree
      in Business Administration.
    </p>
    <p>
      She has developed a passion for Executive Home Improvement, apart from successfully managing high end cabinetry
      installations.
    </p>
    <p>
      Her attention to detail is relentless and she will never leave a client dissatisfied at any cost. Through her
      “hands-on” approach in every business engagement, she is personally involved in every facet of the business,
      and customers are provided with the ultimate in product and service quality from start to finish.
    </p>
    <p>
      Tamsin believes that “With high end design software, we are able to provide our customers with a presentation
      of how the final result will look in graphic detail before we proceed with production”. She goes on to say:
      “Our production and on-site management is state of the art. All cabinets are purpose made to client
      specification, in accordance with the design. We don’t stick to standard sizes. Our final product is of the
      highest quality”.
    </p>
    <p>
      Tamsin believes in the “art of relationship selling” and “word of mouth” advertising. Her motto is “Our clients
      are our sales force” and “Our customer’s home is our showroom”.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-block {
    padding: clamp(32px, 5vw, 72px) var(--section-pad-x);
  }

  .about-block__heading {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 2.8vw, 40px);
    line-height: 1.06;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin-bottom: clamp(18px, 2vw, 28px);
  }
  /* Held to half the width so a heading breaks into a stacked block instead
     of running as one long line. Full width on a phone, where half a screen
     is too narrow to set a heading in. */
  @media (min-width: 700px) {
    .about-block__heading {
      max-width: 50%;
    }
  }

  .about-block__copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .about-block__copy p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-neutral-700);
  }

  .about-block__list {
    margin: 4px 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px 32px;
  }
  /* The list has the full width to work with now, so it columnises further
     than it did rather than running eleven items down one edge. */
  @media (min-width: 700px) {
    .about-block__list {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1200px) {
    .about-block__list {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  .about-block__list li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 20px;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-neutral-700);
  }
  .about-block__list li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.55em;
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    background: var(--color-accent);
  }
</style>
